<h1>Queue</h1><details><summary>Queue filters · all groups · includes completed</summary><form class="filters"><fieldset><legend>Queue filters</legend><label>Group <input name="group" value=""></label><label>Show completed <input type="checkbox" name="completed" value="1" checked=""></label><button>Filter</button></fieldset></form></details><p>a snapshot updated <time data-time="[timestamp]">[age]</time>.</p><h2>Live tasks</h2><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Live tasks" tabindex="0"><table><tr><th>Queue / task</th><th>Group</th><th>State</th><th>Label / run</th><th>Dependencies</th></tr><tr id="task-a-7"><td>a/7</td><td>gpu</td><td>Queued</td><td><a href="/run?run=a%2Fsame">a/same</a></td><td><a href="/jobs?completed=1#task-a-8">8</a></td></tr></table></div><h2>Completion history</h2><p class="dim">Newest 100 retained completions by end time. Live queue state takes precedence over archived callbacks, including restarted tasks. Fault details require a matching archived attempt. Live history retains up to 100 recently finished tasks plus the newest 64 task IDs; group filtering applies within retained history.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Completion history" tabindex="0"><table id="completion-history"><tr><th>Queue / task</th><th>Label</th><th>Group</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Start</th><th>End</th><th>Faults</th></tr></table></div>
